# nr-exthost-pdf-corpus: recorders and fixtures only, no Rust, no Cargo, no protocol row.
#
# File: native/core/fixtures/MANIFEST.json (the index of fixture sets; hot file of the lead)
# Anchor: the "sets" array, in the order verify-manifests.mjs writes it.
# Text: run, in the integration tree after the wave is merged,
#   node benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/verify-manifests.mjs --write-index
# which adds the two new sets below to the index (their MANIFEST.json files are in this commit):
#   pdf-reader   recorder benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-pdf-reader.mjs
#   pdf-codec    recorder benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-pdf-codec.mjs
#
# Replay tasks of the PDF track read:
#   native/core/fixtures/pdf-reader/goldens/<name>.json   outcome (numPages, per-page view/rotate/viewport/text) and
#                                                         withReadableDataUrls (the same file with CMap and font data urls pdf.js can read)
#   native/core/fixtures/pdf-reader/files/<name>.pdf and samples/<name>.pdf   the bytes
#   native/core/fixtures/pdf-codec/goldens/<name>.json    attempts[] (password label, opened, strings or exception)
#   native/core/fixtures/pdf-codec/files/<name>.pdf
